  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Orientation Visit - ASEAN 5G Ecosystem RTM Series, through Business Council for International Understanding</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The Fifth Generation (5G) Ecosystem Reverse Trade Mission (RTM) Series consists of three separate missions designed to familiarize decision makers from Malaysia, Thailand and Vietnam with U.S. technologies and use cases for 5G wireless networks. The missions will build awareness of the potential applications and enabling regulatory environment that can accelerate 5G rollout and the enhanced security implications. The RTM delegations will travel to up to three cities in the United States for meetings with public and private sector representatives and relevant site visits.</narrative>
  </description>
